Thus we only need to attach task profile to SCB (and keep it). OA and DA do not need task profile linked. However confirm_candidate_preparedness for OA and DA requires candidate_task_profile_linked. So we need to give them a task profile temporarily to prepare them, then we can detach it after they are prepared, freeing the profile for SCB. Since preparing only requires the link at the moment of the action, after that we can detach and the prepared status remains.

Thus we can achieve candidate_prepared OA and DA without them retaining the link.

Similarly, candidate_vehicle_linked OA? Not required in goal. So we can keep OA's vehicle link as VUA (init) or change; not required.

Goal requires candidate_vehicle_linked DA VUB (we will allocate). Goal requires candidate_vehicle_linked SCB VUG (we will allocate after freeing). Goal does not require candidate_vehicle_linked OA; it's okay if it stays VUA.

