Goal requires dispatch_ready for OA and DA (we can achieve via mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready after we have origin/destination availability locked/confirmed and transport leg assembled/loading authorized). Goal also requires dispatch_ready SCA (already true init). So we keep it.

